  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Biosafety Capacity and implement Cartagene Protocoll Extension</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extension Phase  of the Biosafety Capacity Building and Implementation of the Cartagena Protocoll. Based on a tentive request from the Ministry of Science, Technololgy and Vocatioal Traininng

Nat. Inst. for Sc.and Industrial Research (NISIR) is the National Biosafety Focal Point in Zambia. The Norwegian support is targeted at competence building to enable zambia implement the National Biotecnology and Biosafety policy as well as the Cartagena Protocol.  This is an extension of phase.</narrative>
  </description>
